"P1495045190" "Stolen biological battery"
// DetailString :
"P3034559769" "This battery uses organic material to power a weapon. Obviously adapted from recovered Rikti technology, this battery is one of the many items stolen from a local technology company."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - LostMutagen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3446375415" "Blue liquid"
// DetailString :
"P1663250423" "This sample of the Lost's mutagen is sealed in a sturdy glass canister of Rikti design. Large black markings on the container remind you of hazard warnings."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AlienHolyText 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4077155088" "Lost holy text"
// DetailString :
"P1321003575" "You found this book in the Rikti base. Written by hand, it describes a utopian society in which physical labor is unnecessary, in which each member's needs are provided for in full. You can imagine the downtrodden Lost pouring over this manuscript in wonder, longing to belong to such a world."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2748444963" "I've detected a disturbing trend in the activities of the Lost. They've carried out raids against a lot of local businesses: grocers, gas stations, liquor stores. But they've also hit several major tech companies. I think those tech raids may have been ordered by the Lost's masters, the Rikti. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to go investigate a cave where the Lost may be storing the stolen technology.</A> We need to learn more about the connection between the Lost and the Rikti."
// AcceptString :
"P3960881771" "Investigate the cave where the Lost may be storing the stolen technology"
// SendOffString :
"P2360711160" "The Lost have been doing the Rikti's dirty work for a long time, in exchange for their body altering mutagen. We need to know more about this strange symbiosis."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1451554357" "Investigate Lost tech thefts"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1887693934" "Have you been to that cave yet? Do you know what the Rikti are up to?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1722244377" "A tumble of dirty blankets in the corner indicates that the Lost are indeed regular visitors, but your trained ear recognizes the sound of Rikti machinery."

