// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Rikti_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2032277949" "We've got a dangerous situation brewing. The Council has been collecting data on heroes for some time, and we believe they have a full list of all Super Groups registered with the Paragon City government, complete with the powers and weaknesses of each member. What's worse, the Rikti found out about it. They're moving on the Council base as we speak. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to stop the Rikti raid and destroy the Council's files.</A> <color orange>The Council protects its most precious info with heavy duty security protocols, so you'll need a teammate to help you crack into their network.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2833651173" "Stop the Rikti raid and destroy the Council's files"
// SendOffString :
"P2423066148" "Those files may be all the Rikti need to mount another offensive against the city"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4294172664" "Defeat all villains in bunker"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1243069601" "We can't let those Council files fall into the hands of the Rikti"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2826410617" "The Council and the Rikti are both disciplined fighters. A battle between them is sure to be a deadly struggle."

