// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3617741038" "I need your help with a dangerous situation. A group of engineers was working on the Founder's Falls War Wall when they were captured by the Rikti. The Rikti have attempted to bring down War Walls before, and if they can force those engineers to help them, they just might succeed. They knew that we would be aware of the kidnapping, so they've already struck at the Founder's Falls Wall control center. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to rescue the engineers and prevent the Rikti from destroying the force fields that protect the city.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1666129583" "Rescue the engineers and prevent the Rikti from bringing down the force fields"
// SendOffString :
"P4223654883" "If the War Walls fall, Paragon City will be ten times more vulnerable to a Rikti attack or any of the other villain groups who would love to tear the city apart. You'll have to rescue all of the hostages and shut down any computer the Rikti have over-ridden. You'll also have to find and take out any Rikti in the control center to finish this."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P217532470" "Keep force fields from falling"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2978657914" "I need you to rescue those engineers. If you don't find them soon, the Rikti will could bring down War Walls all across the city."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1299296667" "The machinery in here seems to be straining with vast and invisible energies as it keeps the War Walls in operation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3593509955" "Dr. Zweibell"
// Description :
"P483706904" "engineers to rescue"
// SingularDescription :
"P3357468162" "Rescue the last engineer!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2247415266" "We did our best to delay them, {Rescuer}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P874774245" "Engineer"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3573805686" "There's no time to shut things down! Destroy the over-ridden devices!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1613707847" "They've over-ridden a number of computers and devices. There's no time to shut them down!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
