"P404478653" "Over-ridden Deconstruction mainframe"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3087306143" "You defeated the Rikti and prevented them from destroying the force fields."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3046508116" "Well, {HeroName}, you may have just prevented a major Rikti assault. According to those engineers you rescued, the Rikti needed to bring down the War walls in order to over-ride the teleportation network. With that kind of transportation, we would have seen strike forces all over the city within hours. The people of this city sure owe you a debt of gratitude today."
// RandomFameString :
"P3421878808" "Aren't these force fields marvelous? Just looking at the War Walls makes me feel safe."

