"P1300040891" "Modified weapons parts"
// DetailString :
"P101293549" "These parts were manufactured by Crey Industries. They have been modified in many small ways, and would now mesh perfectly with a Rikti plasma weapon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2043048746" "The city's trying to crack down on illegal peddling of recovered Rikti technology, but it's not an easy job. As long as companies are willing to pay through the nose for this stuff, there will be scavengers there to supply them. One of my sources suspects that a sale is going down in an abandoned office building right now. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to stop the illegal sale of Rikti technology and arrest the buyers.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P471157602" "Stop the sale of Rikti technology and arrest the buyers"
// SendOffString :
"P1356610941" "that stuff is too dangerous to be in the hands of companies who only want to use it for financial gain."

