// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P963010131" "Search caves for POWs"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1230718015" "Those POWs are counting on you, {HeroName}. Get on it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4011326133" "You hear a human voice pleading, and the sound of a man in tears."

