// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P623892331" "You rescued the POWs and uncovered some valuable information about the Rikti."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P165741415" "You did an incredible job saving those soldiers, {HeroName}. A lot of those people had been presumed dead. I can't imagine how happy their families will be to get them back. <br><br>The story from that medic you rescued is kind of odd, though. He's probably seen more Rikti biology up close than almost anyone, it would certainly be strange if he thinks that human and Rikti biology have a lot in common. That's interesting. I don't know what that means just yet, but it certainly raises some questions."
// RandomFameString :
"P3266844125" "My best friend was captured in the Rikti War, but he's back home now, thanks to {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Rikti_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1706720038" "The Rikti War may have ended, but there are still Rikti on Earth, and they're still causing trouble. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Heroes need to battle against the Rikti constantly to protect the city</A> Constant vigilance is our only defense."
// AcceptString :
"P982942628" "Battle the Rikti wherever they may be."
// SendOffString :
"P1432597479" "Rikti have been sighted working openly in several areas of the city, including Founders' Falls and Crey's Folly, but they're plans and schemes can be found in other areas as well. Any time you can fight the Rikti menace will be a help to the city, and humanity at large."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4223227674" "Battle the Rikti menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3166670092" "The Rikti nearly destroyed the world and never even tried to explain why. The danger they represent is staggering, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2111132325" "You have defeated enough Rikti for the time being."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3420725710" "The Rikti aren't going to go away for some time, {HeroName}. It will take the effort of the world's strongest heroes to defeat them once and for all. Heroes like you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Rikti_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4268685564" "The science facilities in what's now Crey's Folly were one of the first places in the city the Rikti attacked. The pollution and ruin of the entire zone were the end result. However, it seems the Rikti aren't done there yet. The Rikti have been in Crey's Folly working on their own agenda. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'm sure you understand that the Rikti's agenda has to be stopped</A> no matter what it is or where."
// AcceptString :
"P2042820682" "Disrupt the Rikti's unknown agenda by fighting them in Crey's Folly"
// SendOffString :
"P853812124" "The Rikti made that polluted wasteland, I don't like to think about what they may be planning to do there for a follow-up. Their effort is probably going toward some larger plan that could imperil the whole city."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1689482680" "Battle Rikti efforts in Crey's Folly"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3213179504" "I can't even imagine what those aliens are working on in Crey's Folly, {HeroName}. You'll have to fight them to make sure that they don't achieve their goals, whatever they may be."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2618238099" "You have defeated enough Rikti."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P960108252" "You did a great job against the Rikti, {HeroName}. It's good to know that this generation is willing and able to take the battle right back to the invaders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Rikti_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3561521763" "It's a bit of a twist on the normal way things are, but there are reports of Rikti in Crey's Folly who have started scavenging old human equipment. I can't imagine what they could be looking for, but <A HREF={ACCEPT}>the Rikti scavenging operations in Crey's Folly have got to be stopped.</A> I don't know if they're just scanning, scavenging, or partying with the Freakshow, but they can't be allowed to make further inroads there."
// AcceptString :
"P3952083903" "Battle Rikti operations in Crey's Folly"
// SendOffString :
"P4212247915" "There are Rikti troopers in many places in the zone. Every one you defeat hinders their operations, so be as aggressive as safety allows. You might want to concentrate your search around Tangle Town or the old Crey Factories, but any place you can battle the Rikti should work fine."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P781412883" "Disrupt Rikti salvage in Crey's Folly"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3007058731" "Go to Crey's Folly and defeat Rikti."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3190748739" "You have defeated enough Rikti for the moment."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2944967975" "The Rikti are so far ahead of us technologically, I have to wonder what they could be looking for in Crey's Folly? They certainly aren't talking, and Crey Industries is tight-lipped as always. The important thing is that they don't succeed, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Rikti_Mission3.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - RANDOM_MEDICAL 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P745006128" "I need your help with a dangerous situation. A group of engineers was working on the War Walls near Talos Island when they were captured by the Rikti. The Rikti have attempted to bring down War Walls before, and if they can force those engineers to help them, they just might succeed. The good news is that the villains have been isolated in an emergency forcefield. The bad news is that it may not prevent their equipment from affecting the War Walls. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to rescue the engineers and prevent the Rikti from destroying the force fields that protect the city.</A>"
// SendOffString :
"P729386425" "If the War Walls fall, Paragon City will be ten times more vulnerable to a Rikti attack. You'll have to rescue all of the hostages and shut down any computer the Rikti have over-ridden."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2900371752" "Stop Rikti commander & his crew"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2424568570" "Without the War Walls, Talos will be in deep trouble!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2877419562" "Please! Don't let the walls fall!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P909727239" "You've got to keep the War Walls up!"

